WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.366 --> 00:00:05.633
The rock that trapped Mairin's Chespie

2
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.733
has begun to move towards Anistar City's sundial.

3
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.700
If the giant rock and the sundial come together,

4
00:00:13.766 --> 00:00:17.700
they threaten to create an explosion that would swallow not only Kalos,

5
00:00:17.766 --> 00:00:19.233
but the entire world.

6
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:22.733
With time running out,

7
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:27.533
the Kalos Gym Leaders have joined forces with our heroes and their friends.

8
00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:40.233
Everybody head toward the Water Shuriken.

9
00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.233
That's where Chespie is. We've got to save Chespie first.

10
00:01:23.633 --> 00:01:25.833
Forming a more perfect union.

11
00:01:32.233 --> 00:01:34.000
Pikachu, Iron Tail.

12
00:01:37.166 --> 00:01:38.566
Use Flamethrower.

13
00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:49.000
Use Flamethrower.

14
00:01:55.366 --> 00:01:56.200
Do it.

15
00:02:00.733 --> 00:02:02.400
Come on, hurry.

16
00:02:04.133 --> 00:02:05.066
Thanks a lot.

17
00:02:08.333 --> 00:02:10.199
- Valerie.
- Don't worry about me.

18
00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:12.133
I'll help out here.

19
00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:14.100
- Save that Chespin.
- Got it.

20
00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:18.966
All of you, take care, okay?

21
00:02:35.133 --> 00:02:37.133
- Korrina!
- You go on ahead.

22
00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:39.400
- I'll deal with this.
- Okay, thanks.

23
00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:45.333
Korrina.

24
00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:48.400
You guys need to turn around and run.

25
00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:50.733
Got it.

26
00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:55.433
Gogoat, use Grass Knot.

27
00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:00.866
Oh, no, Ramos.

28
00:03:01.333 --> 00:03:05.100
It looks like it's up to you. Go for it, Ash.

29
00:03:18.366 --> 00:03:19.600
Use Rock Tomb.

30
00:03:25.666 --> 00:03:27.100
Faster, faster.

31
00:03:27.566 --> 00:03:28.400
Viola.

32
00:03:30.566 --> 00:03:32.500
No, Grant. Viola, are you okay?

33
00:03:32.966 --> 00:03:36.233
- Just get past that wall.
- Do it now.

34
00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:48.600
Ice Shard, go.

35
00:03:53.433 --> 00:03:56.600
Hurry up, young ones.

36
00:04:02.866 --> 00:04:03.966
There it is.

37
00:04:06.866 --> 00:04:08.300
We need to make a path.

38
00:04:08.766 --> 00:04:10.033
Take care of Chespie.

39
00:04:10.466 --> 00:04:12.233
Don't worry. We'll handle it.

40
00:04:12.533 --> 00:04:13.366
No doubt.

41
00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:17.233
Dark Pulse, go.

42
00:04:21.566 --> 00:04:23.133
Dragon Rage.

43
00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:33.633
Professor.

44
00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:35.700
- Keep going, you two.
- Just go.

45
00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:38.800
We won't let you down. Count on it.

46
00:04:44.233 --> 00:04:47.600
Chespie, everyone's doing their best for you.

47
00:04:52.166 --> 00:04:53.766
Luxray, use Swift.

48
00:04:55.166 --> 00:04:56.633
Bunnelby, use Mud Shot.

49
00:04:57.500 --> 00:04:59.733
- Now, go.
- Thanks, Clemont.

50
00:05:16.766 --> 00:05:20.666
- Don't just stand there, twerp.
- Chespie's waiting. Step on it.

51
00:05:20.833 --> 00:05:21.900
Move.

52
00:05:22.266 --> 00:05:23.100
Team Rocket.

53
00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:30.266
You okay?

54
00:05:30.333 --> 00:05:33.233
You've got to preserve the moment with pictures.

55
00:05:41.766 --> 00:05:43.700
Don't worry about the vines.

56
00:05:43.766 --> 00:05:45.233
Keep moving forward.

57
00:05:45.766 --> 00:05:47.666
Our future depends upon it.

58
00:05:48.033 --> 00:05:49.633
- Use Psychic.
- Use Psychic.

59
00:06:09.933 --> 00:06:12.000
Why are they giving so much?

60
00:06:12.066 --> 00:06:14.300
I've realized from observing them

61
00:06:14.366 --> 00:06:17.200
that this is how people and Pokémon really are.

62
00:06:19.800 --> 00:06:20.633
Over there.

63
00:06:22.833 --> 00:06:26.033
Pikachu, Electro Ball. Greninja, Water Shuriken.

64
00:06:26.100 --> 00:06:27.900
Charizard, Flamethrower.

65
00:06:34.666 --> 00:06:36.400
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

66
00:06:36.733 --> 00:06:38.700
- Let's go.
- Over there.

67
00:06:38.766 --> 00:06:40.800
- Hurry up.
- Let's go.

68
00:06:40.866 --> 00:06:42.600
- Do it now.
- Let's go.

69
00:06:42.666 --> 00:06:48.600
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

70
00:06:48.666 --> 00:06:49.500
Let's go.

71
00:07:10.433 --> 00:07:11.600
Chespie.

72
00:07:12.733 --> 00:07:13.566
Hang on.

73
00:07:16.333 --> 00:07:20.200
I'll cover you as best I can, Alain. Now you go and get Chespie.

74
00:07:20.966 --> 00:07:23.533
Now, Charizard, help me out. Come on.

75
00:07:28.933 --> 00:07:31.600
Pikachu, Electro Ball. And Greninja, use Cut.

76
00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:44.100
Everyone, go.

77
00:07:56.733 --> 00:08:00.733
Don't stop, Alain. Greninja, Water Shuriken.

78
00:08:10.366 --> 00:08:11.966
Chespie. It's Alain.

79
00:08:12.766 --> 00:08:17.133
I've come to get you out of here. Let's go back to Mairin together.

80
00:08:35.333 --> 00:08:37.000
It's Ash and Alain.

81
00:08:37.266 --> 00:08:38.466
Chespie.

82
00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:40.233
That's what I call success.

83
00:08:43.566 --> 00:08:44.533
Ash, you did it.

84
00:08:44.600 --> 00:08:46.100
Yes. All right.

85
00:08:49.733 --> 00:08:52.266
Just marvelous. A job well done, Alain.

86
00:09:01.733 --> 00:09:03.766
Chespie, I've got you.

87
00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:06.500
Thank you so much.

88
00:09:10.533 --> 00:09:13.466
All that's left is what's in front of us.

89
00:09:18.466 --> 00:09:20.300
Let's all attack together.

90
00:09:23.133 --> 00:09:24.133
Now.

91
00:09:32.633 --> 00:09:33.666
Did it work?

92
00:09:34.333 --> 00:09:35.166
Pika.

93
00:09:47.133 --> 00:09:50.066
- It can't be.
- I know. But how?

94
00:09:52.700 --> 00:09:53.700
Lysandre.

95
00:10:00.566 --> 00:10:03.100
Even if you're somehow able to stop me,

96
00:10:03.166 --> 00:10:06.900
I will still destroy the world. Count on it.

97
00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:10.666
Who's that Pokémon?

98
00:10:15.033 --> 00:10:17.000
It's Houndoom.

99
00:10:23.966 --> 00:10:26.533
Lysandre. How is he doing this?

100
00:10:27.166 --> 00:10:30.300
The countdown to destruction will not stop.

101
00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:35.633
Here it comes.

102
00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:37.600
Light Screen, quick.

103
00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:49.700
- Such power.
- Will this insanity never end?

104
00:10:49.766 --> 00:10:53.033
If it reaches the sundial, cut. That's a wrap.

105
00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:04.666
Pikachu and Greninja.

106
00:11:04.733 --> 00:11:06.466
- Pika, Pika.
- Ninja.

107
00:11:06.533 --> 00:11:08.733
Charizard, you're not hurt, are you?

108
00:11:16.233 --> 00:11:18.166
So, what happened?

109
00:11:23.666 --> 00:11:24.600
Dad?

110
00:11:24.666 --> 00:11:27.833
Guilty as charged.

111
00:11:27.900 --> 00:11:31.700
- You all right? Are you hurt?
- Don't worry. I'm just fine.

112
00:11:32.366 --> 00:11:34.433
- Are you two all right?
- Mm-hm.

113
00:11:40.366 --> 00:11:41.366
It's moving.

114
00:11:41.833 --> 00:11:44.366
- How do we make it stop?
- Listen to me.

115
00:11:44.433 --> 00:11:48.100
The power that's moving it has to do with the device on Lysandre's arm.

116
00:11:50.066 --> 00:11:52.100
Then it must be destroyed now.

117
00:11:52.166 --> 00:11:55.100
- That will stop it?
- We have to try anything.

118
00:11:55.166 --> 00:11:59.600
We've got to give it everything we have left. It's our only chance.

119
00:11:59.666 --> 00:12:00.866
Right.

120
00:12:02.533 --> 00:12:06.933
So, they will fight? Against that tremendous evil.

121
00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:09.500
Neither humans, nor Pokémon give up.

122
00:12:10.033 --> 00:12:15.033
- But they're far too weak.
- None of them think they're weak. Hmm.

123
00:12:17.533 --> 00:12:19.666
You should have seen this by now.

124
00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:24.133
It's true that humans are weak and powerless.

125
00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:27.433
But they have dreams and they believe in each other.

126
00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:31.400
They stand together and feel empathy for each other.

127
00:12:31.466 --> 00:12:33.233
That is their real strength.

128
00:12:33.766 --> 00:12:36.500
They have the power to believe in themselves

129
00:12:36.566 --> 00:12:40.766
and within themselves, they somehow find the will to succeed.

130
00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:03.533
Then I will believe in them.

131
00:13:03.600 --> 00:13:05.866
- Now you understand.
- Yes.

132
00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:09.566
- Squishy.
- Bonnie, wait.

133
00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:15.066
I am Zygarde, defender of order.

134
00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:20.766
We will show them our full power.

135
00:13:20.833 --> 00:13:23.066
You won't destroy the world.

136
00:13:36.133 --> 00:13:37.000
What's this?

137
00:13:59.633 --> 00:14:01.133
Oh, Squishy.

138
00:14:01.666 --> 00:14:03.566
Is that Zygarde?

139
00:14:04.333 --> 00:14:07.633
Those deep green eyes. That is it.

140
00:14:08.300 --> 00:14:11.200
The Forme when all has become one.

141
00:14:13.100 --> 00:14:13.966
Become one?

142
00:14:14.933 --> 00:14:17.966
And still you hid this Forme?

143
00:14:18.300 --> 00:14:21.966
You must have been seeing the world in the same way I was.

144
00:14:22.033 --> 00:14:26.200
The unlimited greed of humans has sent the world spinning into chaos.

145
00:14:26.266 --> 00:14:27.866
Have you not felt that?

146
00:14:28.766 --> 00:14:33.533
If I had not raised my objections, the world would continue on its warped path.

147
00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:37.700
But now you choose to appear. What could possibly be left to defend?

148
00:14:37.766 --> 00:14:40.200
You have no right!

149
00:14:42.733 --> 00:14:46.266
If it is a right you speak of, this world belongs to them.

150
00:14:46.666 --> 00:14:50.666
I have placed my hopes in humanity. They have always protected me.

151
00:14:50.966 --> 00:14:53.200
They kept their promise not to leave my side.

152
00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:55.666
Now it is my turn.

153
00:14:55.733 --> 00:14:58.433
I will incinerate you.

154
00:15:21.366 --> 00:15:23.466
Impudent fool.

155
00:15:23.533 --> 00:15:27.566
All right, Pikachu, use Thunderbolt. Greninja, use Water Shuriken.

156
00:15:28.333 --> 00:15:30.233
Charizard, use Flamethrower.

157
00:15:39.866 --> 00:15:45.200
It can't be. It must be a mistake. All of my meticulous planning was perfect.

158
00:16:03.700 --> 00:16:04.666
Squishy.

159
00:16:11.433 --> 00:16:14.766
Kalos. I will protect you.

160
00:16:14.833 --> 00:16:17.366
Squishy. Go for it.

161
00:16:24.633 --> 00:16:29.333
Not yet, move. It's not over yet.

162
00:16:56.666 --> 00:16:58.300
That is a wrap.

163
00:16:58.866 --> 00:17:01.366
Take a look. Look what we did, world.

164
00:17:01.900 --> 00:17:05.400
That giant monstrosity is gone, but we're still standing.

165
00:17:06.033 --> 00:17:09.633
- Yeah.
- The threat to Kalos is history.

166
00:17:14.466 --> 00:17:16.433
The sundial was protected.

167
00:17:16.900 --> 00:17:18.366
Thank you, everyone.

168
00:17:19.900 --> 00:17:22.099
We won. We really won.

169
00:17:25.333 --> 00:17:26.700
Where's Lysandre?

170
00:17:27.633 --> 00:17:28.666
Who knows?

171
00:17:31.800 --> 00:17:33.666
You leave Team Flare to me.

172
00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:37.966
When I'm done cleaning them up, I'll drop in on Officer Jenny.

173
00:17:46.166 --> 00:17:49.533
Chespie, you're awake. You're awake.

174
00:17:51.566 --> 00:17:52.400
Alain.

175
00:17:53.466 --> 00:17:55.266
Look at Chespie.

176
00:17:56.133 --> 00:17:57.600
I'm so happy for you.

177
00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:01.133
- Mairin?
- Hm?

178
00:18:02.833 --> 00:18:04.000
Please forgive me.

179
00:18:04.733 --> 00:18:06.133
For everything I did.

180
00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:08.633
Stop.

181
00:18:09.633 --> 00:18:11.633
I'm just happy you're all right.

182
00:18:19.000 --> 00:18:20.633
Squishy. Thanks a lot.

183
00:18:21.566 --> 00:18:25.600
Bonnie, I only did what you have done for me all along.

184
00:18:25.666 --> 00:18:29.066
It is I who should thank you. I'm so grateful.

185
00:19:06.966 --> 00:19:11.966
It's you. I would like to express my gratitude to you as well. Thank you.

186
00:19:12.400 --> 00:19:13.733
Chespie!

187
00:19:16.366 --> 00:19:17.200
Bonnie.

188
00:19:17.733 --> 00:19:21.966
To have journeyed with you and to have learned about humans from you.

189
00:19:22.666 --> 00:19:23.966
I am grateful.

190
00:19:25.733 --> 00:19:27.166
Is this goodbye?

191
00:19:28.466 --> 00:19:31.966
I'm tired. I think I'd like to rest in the sun.

192
00:19:34.233 --> 00:19:36.266
I'm glad to have met you.

193
00:19:54.766 --> 00:19:56.233
Oh, Squishy.

194
00:19:57.100 --> 00:19:59.300
I'm glad that I met you, too.

195
00:19:59.600 --> 00:20:00.600
Dedenne.

196
00:20:01.233 --> 00:20:03.333
I'll never forget you, Bonnie.

197
00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:07.166
I love you, Squishy.

198
00:20:07.633 --> 00:20:09.166
I love you.

199
00:20:27.166 --> 00:20:30.900
And so, the final curtain falls on Team Flare

200
00:20:30.966 --> 00:20:33.233
and their threat to the Kalos region.

201
00:20:35.100 --> 00:20:40.266
The sun now rises again on the world that Ash and his friends protected

202
00:20:40.333 --> 00:20:42.433
as the journey continues.
